UID:cvs-seminar-mudway-20260617
DTSTART:20260617T120000
DTEND:20260617T130000
SUMMARY:CVS Seminar: The Siege of Biological Barriers — From Pulmonary Insult to Blood-Brain Barrier Dysfunction
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Dr Ian Mudway (Imperial College London). Title: The Siege of Biological Barriers: From Pulmonary Insult to Blood-Brain Barrier Dysfunction.\nHost: Sari Pennings.\nDr Mudway is Associate Professor of Environmental Toxicology, head of Environmental Toxicology group at Imperial College London. Gresham College Visiting Professor for Environmental Health. 30+ years experience researching air pollution impacts on human health. Published 200+ papers.\nSocial: Pizza in The Larder 13:00-13:30.
LOCATION:Wellcome Theatre, QMRI
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
